      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pension Helper – Workspaces\nCalled only by the backend (secret header): POST /pension-workspace\n{\"action\": \"get\" | \"upsert\", \"key\": \"w12\", \"values\": {kind, name, email, da_old, da_new, da_new_from}}\n\nEvery signed-up office or family has one workspace. Its key is the `dataset` value on all of its rows in the other tables. The scheduled workflows read this table for DA rates and the office email for the daily summary.",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 580,
        "height": 220
      }
